# Airline Engine Maintenance Data Platform

A production-inspired Data Engineering project that simulates the lifecycle of CFM56-7B aircraft engines.

## Current Progress

✅ Synthetic Data Generation Complete
✅ Modular Generator Architecture Complete
✅ ETL Extract Layer Complete
✅ ETL Dimension Transformation Complete
✅ Fact Table Transformations Complete 
🚧 PostgreSQL Data Warehouse In Progress
⏳ Airflow Orchestration
⏳ Dashboard & Analytics

## Planned Architecture

Python → CSV → Airflow → PostgreSQL → Kafka → Spark → Iceberg → dbt → Grafana